//! The 21 grammars of gositter v0.2.0. Each `<g>/mod.rs`, `<g>/lex.rs` and `<g>/tables.bin` is
//! generated by `gengrammar` from the `parser.c` pinned in `grammars.lock`; each `<g>/scanner.rs`
//! is a hand port of gositter's `scanner.go`. A grammar is declared here once it compiles.

